&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with workflow orchestration (Argo, Airflow, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with large-scale distributed systems or products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Big data and distributed data-processing tooling (Spark, PyArrow, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with 3D sensor data (point clouds, sensor fusion, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous work in AV, robotics, or ML-heavy environments&lt;/li&gt;
