&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2&quot;&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a fast-moving team of engineers building the Remote Control system that powers teleoperation and fleet management for autonomous cars and delivery robots. Our tools enable operators to assist vehicles in complex urban environments via real-time video, map-based navigation, and custom interfaces optimized for low-latency decision-making. We care about performance, reliability, and thoughtful UX design — all in service of safe and scalable autonomy operations.&lt;/p&gt;
