&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Frontend Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to help us push the boundaries of what real-time web interfaces can do. You’ll be responsible for developing the operator-facing frontend of our Remote Control stack - the live command center that humans use to assist cars and robots in the wild.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, high-impact role where your work directly shapes how autonomy operates at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
