&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2&quot;&gt;About Avride&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Avride is a U.S.-based autonomous vehicle startup headquartered in Austin, TX, with additional R&amp;amp;D hubs around the world. Our company develops and operates both autonomous cars and delivery robots that share technologies and mutually benefit from each other’s advancements—a unique approach in the industry. Since 2017, Avride has been building expertise in autonomous technologies to create solutions that address current needs and anticipate future demands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a dependable and detail-oriented Warehouse &amp;amp; Logistics Associate to support its daily logistics and materials management operations.&lt;br&gt;In this role, you will be responsible for receiving, storing, handling, and preparing materials for shipment in compliance with internal procedures and safety standards.&lt;br&gt;The ideal candidate will be organized, safety-minded, and experienced with warehouse systems and equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Material Handling and Storage:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Store, stack, and palletize materials using proper storage methods and safety guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rearrange storage areas and support inventory audits to maintain accurate inventory records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regularly inspect stored items and report signs of deterioration or damage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shipping, Receiving, and Logistics:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in packaging, labeling, and routing materials for shipping or storage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support inbound and outbound logistics activities, including checking and documenting shipments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and report shipment discrepancies, missing items, or damaged goods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure inventory is tracked, tagged, and managed accurately in inventory systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equipment Operation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Safely operate forklifts, pallet jacks, hand trucks, carts, and other material handling tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform routine inspections and basic maintenance of warehouse equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Administrative Support:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
